1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,700
The calls for a ceasefire are outrageous.

2
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:29,760
You know, as Americans, I'm confident we believe in honesty and decency,

3
00:00:30,400 --> 00:00:33,040
treating everyone with dignity and respect,

4
00:00:33,840 --> 00:00:39,740
giving everyone a fair shot,

5
00:00:40,380 --> 00:00:43,920
leaving no one behind, giving hate no safe harbor,

6
00:00:49,920 --> 00:00:51,360
and demonizing no one.

7
00:00:51,660 --> 00:01:01,340
We hope to now always recognize there's something bigger than ourselves as we're about.

8
00:01:04,790 --> 00:01:07,730
Look, I've said it before and I'll keep saying it.

9
00:01:08,610 --> 00:01:09,950
America is an idea.

10
00:01:19,070 --> 00:01:21,470
It's the most powerful idea in the history of the world.

11
00:01:25,800 --> 00:01:28,400
And I believe it beats in the hearts of the people of this country.

